==Slovene==

===Etymology===
From the noun '''[[Španec#Slovene|Španec]]''' + the general possessive suffix '''[[-ski#Slovene|-ski]]'''.

===Adjective===
'''španski'''  {{m}}

# [[Spanish]] (of the nation, its language, or its culture)
#: ''časopis '''španski'''''
#:: ''a '''Spanish''' newspaper''

====Usage notes====
* Unlike most Slovene adjectives, '''španski''' has no specifically indefinite form.  The definite form also serves as the indefinite form.

